    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Soccer in a Box&quot; is a soccer game that supports 2-8 players competing on the same stage. Use various dances to kick all the balls into the opponent's goal! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game content</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2-8 players online play. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3231990/extras/7c8788c30b1cd1fbc32f81d700a65e9a.poster.avif?t=1755177561\" width=450 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3231990/extras/7c8788c30b1cd1fbc32f81d700a65e9a.webm?t=1755177561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3231990/extras/7c8788c30b1cd1fbc32f81d700a65e9a.mp4?t=1755177561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich custom costumes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3231990/extras/442fee2a3faeb72ebcc8f04f57968ce2.poster.avif?t=1755177561\" width=450 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3231990/extras/442fee2a3faeb72ebcc8f04f57968ce2.webm?t=1755177561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3231990/extras/442fee2a3faeb72ebcc8f04f57968ce2.mp4?t=1755177561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various cool dances. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3231990/extras/bfdba81adbb1040489f5e9d462503768.poster.avif?t=1755177561\" width=450 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3231990/extras/bfdba81adbb1040489f5e9d462503768.webm?t=1755177561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3231990/extras/bfdba81adbb1040489f5e9d462503768.mp4?t=1755177561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich venue/environment/ball changes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3231990/extras/a93cd563fbf0adef456ca44aabcc1a93.poster.avif?t=1755177561\" width=450 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3231990/extras/a93cd563fbf0adef456ca44aabcc1a93.webm?t=1755177561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3231990/extras/a93cd563fbf0adef456ca44aabcc1a93.mp4?t=1755177561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Special thanks</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>CandyWind, Vescrity, Rolone, LeafSong, PakchoL, Jamesika, Xue.\ud83e\udd73, Lanchen, Lilac, Wtchen</i></p>",
